        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9027P, Bar Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its sleek style, the Bar Appliance Pull is a great addition to any modern home. Choose from 18 inch or 12 inch lengths in any of 6 contemporary finishes. The Omnia made 9027P Appliance Pull is made out of solid brass so it can withstand heavy use (hey, it's the refrigerator, right?). It can be used on vacuum sealed refrigerators as well as other high-end appliances. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see the matching <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9027\"><b>Bar Cabinet Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9027P Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9027P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9027P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
